  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging the Gaps: Strengthening Mental Health Support for Children and Young Pe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IsraAID are proposing to set up mobile child friendly spaces (CFS) so they can deliver health and wellbeing activities to underserved children in refugee camp and settlement areas; strengthen the capacity of children as agents of their own protection by mentoring and building the capacity of child champions focused on public speaking, child rights and mental health; strengthen the capacity of parents, caregivers and community members to respond to child protection issues; raise awareness of the availability of mental health services; and refer patients experiencing mental health issues to services which can help, in Turkana county.</narrative>
  </description>
